(1)   23/  C1D65A :                         ; Do NOT set up the IGM in SYSTEM_IO, because the game will then be able to mess with the fix during the current frame
(1)   24/  C1D65A :                         ; In SYSTEM_INT1, check if the IGM flag is set. If so, set up the IGM:
(1)   25/  C1D65A :                         ; Save fix bank #0 somewhere and the palette in extended RAM ($110000+)
(1)   26/  C1D65A :                         ; Load the in-game menu fix bank in fix bank #0 and the IGM palette
(1)   27/  C1D65A :                         ; Let inserted code in SYSTEM_INT1 (IGMVBL) handle the UI
(1)   28/  C1D65A :                         
